{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truck Racing Simulator puts you in the driver\u2019s seat of pure chaos and control\u2014feel the roar of the engine, the thrill of tight turns, and the rush of leaving rivals in the dust. It\u2019s all about adrenaline, grit, and the joy of heavy-duty speed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/8e027bbd6fbd577a70529727714cc084.poster.avif?t=1772546959\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/8e027bbd6fbd577a70529727714cc084.webm?t=1772546959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/8e027bbd6fbd577a70529727714cc084.mp4?t=1772546959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Truck Racing Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truck Racing Simulator delivers fast-paced action with heavyweight machines. Jump into Quick Race mode, pick from 3 powerful trucks, and battle against 4 fierce opponents across 2 intense tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/a27e312fb05fdd6fa0a3b4aeabc7ef63.poster.avif?t=1772546959\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/a27e312fb05fdd6fa0a3b4aeabc7ef63.webm?t=1772546959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/a27e312fb05fdd6fa0a3b4aeabc7ef63.mp4?t=1772546959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tight corners, overtake in epic straights, and feel the thrill of racing with massive metal beasts. Built for fun, speed, and pure excitement, every match keeps your heart pounding and your skills sharp.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939560?t=1772546959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939560?t=1772546959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/72a4869da7159ef385f18913ab285e26956a850f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772546959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/72a4869da7159ef385f18913ab285e26956a850f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772546959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Truck Racing Simulator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/d40c0bd35a97dae91aef3732f4c0a92d.avif?t=1772546959\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truck Racing Simulator puts you in the driver\u2019s seat of pure chaos and control\u2014feel the roar of the engine, the thrill of tight turns, and the rush of leaving rivals in the dust. It\u2019s all about adrenaline, grit, and the joy of heavy-duty speed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/8e027bbd6fbd577a70529727714cc084.poster.avif?t=1772546959\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939560/extras/8e027